1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:08,971
S N one: substitution, nucleophilic, unimolecular, typical of tertiary halides like tertiary butyl bromide.

2
00:00:08,971 --> 00:00:11,054
It happens in two steps.

3
00:00:11,054 --> 00:00:18,072
First, slowly, the carbon bromine bond breaks all by itself, leaving a carbocation.

4
00:00:18,072 --> 00:00:20,169
The carbocation is flat.

